From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 20:00:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add BiLSTM + self-attention HAR classifier and writeup

Fills activity_ml/'s empty classifier.py/inference.py stubs with a
single trained model: a bidirectional LSTM with genuine multi-head
self-attention over MuRAL event windows. This was the best-performing
of several architectures tried (plain attention pooling and a pure
Transformer both scored lower on every metric), so only this one is
checked in here.

Includes the trained checkpoint, metrics, predictions, and training
figures under artifacts/activity_ml/, plus docs/HAR.md with the full
model definition, hyperparameters, per-class precision/recall/F1
table, confusion matrix, and training curve.

